@api = http://localhost:3020/api/v1
@email = reemplazar
@password = reemplazar
@token = reemplazar
@empresaId = reemplazar

### Login: elegir mongodb o supabase. Copiar data.token sin subirlo al repositorio.
POST {{api}}/sesiones
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}","password":"{{password}}","baseDatos":"mongodb"}

### Consultar sesión
GET {{api}}/sesiones/actual
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear empresa
POST {{api}}/empresas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"simbolo":"DEMO","nombre":"Empresa de prueba","mercado":"DEMO"}

### Consultar empresas
GET {{api}}/empresas?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reemplazar empresa
PUT {{api}}/empresas/{{empresaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: "1"

{"simbolo":"DEMO","nombre":"Empresa actualizada","mercado":"DEMO","activo":true}

### Crear varias empresas
POST {{api}}/empresas/lote
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"items":[{"simbolo":"DEMO2","nombre":"Segunda","mercado":"DEMO"},{"simbolo":"DEMO3","nombre":"Tercera","mercado":"DEMO"}]}

### Eliminar empresa sin referencias
DELETE {{api}}/empresas/{{empresaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cerrar sesión
DELETE {{api}}/sesiones/actual
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
